{"id":"4964","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4964_main_polar-stratospheric-clouds-nacreous_special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>珍母云或珍珠母云是一种主要由冰构成的极地平流层云。这些云仅在低于冰霜点的温度下在平流层形成，通常接近-85°C。冬季时，只有两个半球的高纬度地区才能达到平流层中的这种低温。</p>\n<p>珠母云的特点是呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">虹彩色</span>，在黄昏时变得更加明亮，并且通常呈现<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状波云</span>的形式。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Svein Idar Iversen","location":"挪威Gjøvik","latitude":"纬度: 60° 47' 43'' N","longitude":"经度: 10° 41' 30'' E","date":"25 January 2008 1518 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.1"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4907_main_polar-stratospheric-clouds-nacreous_others-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>主要由冰构成的极地平流层云被珠母云或珍珠母云。如瑞典的这张照片所示，日落之后，它们的特点是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">鲜艳的彩虹色</span>。</p>\n<p>在冬季，两个半球高纬度地区当温度低于冰霜点（通常接近-85°C）温度时，珠母云仅在平流层形成。它们通常是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状的</span>。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Albert de Nijs","location":"瑞典利马NV","latitude":"纬度: 60° 56' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 13° 21' 44'' E","date":"22 December 2014 1634 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"}]}]}